  "label": "Cute Animal Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on the widespread cultural stereotype that small, cute animals (like piglets) are inherently endearing and make good gifts. This stereotype is used to create humor by juxtaposing the 'cute' appearance with the 'serious' responsibility of pet ownership.",
